                    "content": "```kotlin\nimport java.util.Scanner\n\nconst val MOD = 1_000_000_007L\n\nfun power(base: Long, exp: Long, mod: Long): Long {\n    var result = 1L\n    var b = base % mod\n    if (b < 0) b += mod\n    var e = exp\n    while (e > 0) {\n        if (e and 1L == 1L) {\n            result = result * b % mod\n        }\n        b = b * b % mod\n        e = e shr 1\n    }\n    return result\n}\n\nfun modInverse(a: Long, mod: Long): Long {\n    return power(a, mod - 2, mod)\n}\n\nfun main() {\n    val br = System.`in`.bufferedReader()\n    val line = br.readLine().trim().split(\" \")\n    var n = line[0].toLong()\n    val k = line[1].toInt()\n\n    // Factorize n\n    val factors = LinkedHashMap<Long, Int>()\n    var num = n\n    var i = 2L\n    while (i * i <= num) {\n        if (num % i == 0L) {\n            var cnt = 0\n            while (num % i == 0L) {\n                num /= i\n                cnt++\n            }\n            factors[i] = cnt\n        }\n        i++\n    }\n    if (num > 1L) {\n        factors[num] = (factors[num] ?: 0) + 1\n    }\n\n    var answer = 1L\n\n    for ((p, e) in factors) {\n        // dp array over exponents 0..e\n        var dp = LongArray(e + 1)\n        dp[e] = 1L\n\n        // precompute inverses for 1..(e+1)\n        val inv = LongArray(e + 2)\n        for (j in 1..(e + 1)) {\n            inv[j] = modInverse(j.toLong(), MOD)\n        }\n\n        for (step in 1..k) {\n            val c = LongArray(e + 1)\n            for (idx in 0..e) {\n                c[idx] = dp[idx] * inv[idx + 1] % MOD\n            }\n            val newDp = LongArray(e + 1)\n            var suffix = 0L\n            for (j in e downTo 0) {\n                suffix = (suffix + c[j]) % MOD\n                newDp[j] = suffix\n            }\n            dp = newDp\n        }\n\n        val pMod = p % MOD\n        var contrib = 0L\n        var pPow = 1L // p^0\n        for (j in 0..e) {\n            contrib = (contrib + dp[j] * pPow) % MOD\n            pPow = pPow * pMod % MOD\n        }\n\n        answer = answer * contrib % MOD\n    }\n\n    println(answer)\n}\n```",
